  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-host SEMI expo event</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam is emerging as a key player in high-tech manufacturing, particularly in semiconductors, due to its low-cost labor, strategic location, and global supply chain integration. The Netherlands, through its strategic interest, supports the development of Vietnam&#x2019;s semiconductor industry to diversify global supply and strengthen economic resilience. The present project aims to enhance knowledge in Vietnam&apos;s manufacturing sector and promote job creation by integrating the country into the global semiconductor supply chain. The embassy will co-organize an industry event and networking reception at the SEMI Expo in Hanoi.This project is also connected to the PCB24VN04 Semiconductor Summer School.</narrative>
  </description>
